# Pinned dependency archives that must not depend on a live third-party host.
#
# Format, one entry per line:
#   <content-addressed cache filename> <url it satisfies>
#
# These files are the exact bytes zig would have downloaded, named the way
# zig's global cache names them. `fetch-zig-deps` copies them into
# $ZIG_GLOBAL_CACHE_DIR/p/ and skips the network call for that URL.
#
# translate-c 4e879eb8 (codeberg). Measured 2026-11-20: the host answered the
# site in 0.69 s but the archive timed out at 10 s, then reset the connection
# after 1.1 s, across two CI runs 44 minutes apart. Zig verifies the hash of
# whatever it loads, so a wrong archive here fails loudly instead of building
# against something unexpected.
